#. ~ %1$s is the host address, %2$d is the port number
#: src/mp_gamestate.cpp:8523
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Could not reach %1$s:%2$d ...\n"
"\n"
"1 Make sure the host is in-game and hosting\n"
"2 Ensure both machines are on the same network or VPN.  A \"Connected\" "
"status in Tailscale/Radmin does not guarantee routing, so try the host's "
"other listed address, or toggle the VPN off/on to reset its route.\n"
"3 Turn off any commercial VPN (NordVPN, ExpressVPN, Proton, etc).  It takes "
"over your machine's routing and will send co-op traffic out through the VPN "
"instead of to your partner.\n"
"4 Check the address and check the port isn't firewalled."
msgstr ""
"无法访问 %1$s:%2$d...\n"
"\n"
"1. 请确认主机已经进入游戏\n"
"2. 请确保主客机已连入同一网络或VPN，部分VPN（例如：Tailscale、Radmin）"
"的“已连接”状态并不能保证双方联通，建议尝试主机的其他可用线路进行连接，或"
"重启VPN以重置线路连接。\n"
"3. 关闭商用VPN（例如：NordVPN、ExpressVPN，Proton等）。此类VPN将覆盖"
"设备的端口，并将CO-OP的数据发送到VPN端而非你的同伴。\n"
"4. 请确认地址是否正确，以及端口是否已于防火墙开放"

